# NAME: Captcha
# AUTHOR: GinatWiki
# REPO: https://github.com/GinatWiki/Custom_OpenClash_Rules
# 验证码/人机验证等风控检测服务，统一走专用策略组以固定出口、避免验证失败

# Google reCAPTCHA（含 recaptcha 关键字的域名，覆盖 recaptcha.net 等镜像）
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,recaptcha
# hCaptcha
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hcaptcha.com
# Cloudflare Turnstile / 质询页
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,challenges.cloudflare.com
# Arkose Labs Funcaptcha
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,funcaptcha.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,arkoselabs.com
# GeeTest
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,geetest.com
# OctoCaptcha
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,octocaptcha.com
# Friendly Captcha
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,friendlycaptcha.com
# PerimeterX (HUMAN)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perimeterx.net
# DataDome
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,datadome.co
